            Buying Tip
          </p>
          <p class="text-amber-800 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Before buying any "smart" or app-connected treadmill, confirm
            exactly which software ecosystem it uses and whether that
            ecosystem's core value is locked behind a subscription. Don't
            assume based on price alone, since, as the Sole F80
            demonstrates, a premium-priced treadmill isn't necessarily
